Amazon jungle ki gehri hariyali mein subah ki halki roshni patton ke beech se utar rahi hoti hai. Kohra jungle ko dhire-dhire chhodta hai aur poora jungle jaag uthta hai. Parindon ki tez awaaz, bandaroon ki uchhal-kood aur nadi ki shaant dhara milkar zindagi ka sangeet banate hain. Achaanak jhaadiyon se ek jaguar nikalta hai, khamoshi se apne ilaake par nazar daalta hua. Upar aasman mein rang-birange macaw parindey udte hain aur neeche nadi ke kinaare ek anaconda dheere-dheere sarakta hai. Achanak bijli chamakti hai, halki baarish shuru hoti hai aur jungle aur bhi zyada zinda lagne lagta hai. Amazon jungle sirf ek jungle nahi, balki prakriti ki ek zinda kahani hai, jahan har saans mein taqat aur har pal mein ek naya chamatkar chhupa hota hai. 🌿🎬
